  "body": "When we receive a typing EDU from a remote homeserver, we neglect to check that said homeserver is in the room the typing EDU is for.\r\n\r\nThere was a check that looked like it was doing the job, except it was really checking that the local homeserver is in the room a second time:\r\nhttps://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/1a209efdb2a6c51e52dd277de7581099852877ae/synapse/handlers/typing.py#L365-L369\r\n\r\nrelated: #11456",
